# XRP Ledger Data Analytics & Insights

## Project Information

Date: October 2025

Technologies: Python, Pandas, Data Analysis, Data Visualization

## Project Description

This project focuses on analyzing and preprocessing XRP Ledger transaction records to identify structural patterns, operational characteristics, and behavioral trends within blockchain transaction activity.

## Key Activities

* Analyzed and preprocessed XRP Ledger transaction records to identify structural patterns, operational characteristics, and behavioral trends.
* Performed **Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)** on transaction attributes to derive meaningful insights.
* Created **graphs and charts** to communicate transaction trends and activity patterns effectively.
* Applied **Python-based data processing techniques** to clean, transform, and organize raw ledger data into structured, analysis-ready datasets.
* Examined transaction characteristics to understand variations and patterns within the available ledger data.
* Used data visualization techniques to present analytical findings in an easy-to-understand format.

## Skills Demonstrated

* Python
* Pandas
* Data Cleaning & Preprocessing
* Exploratory Data Analysis
* Data Analysis
* Data Visualization
* Blockchain Data Analysis
* Data Transformation

## Project Outcome

The project demonstrated the application of Python-based data analytics techniques to blockchain transaction data. The raw XRP Ledger records were transformed into structured datasets and analyzed to identify meaningful transaction patterns and trends through exploratory analysis and visualization.
